{"id":"c98701cd6a6317eb","group":"72","path":"72/72-lem-rank-reduction.md","title":"Rank Reduction Lemma","display":"lem-rank-reduction — Rank Reduction Lemma","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-lem-rank-reduction","aliases":["72-lem-rank-reduction"],"display":"lem-rank-reduction — Rank Reduction Lemma","depends_on":["[[72-df-gentzen-system]]","[[72-df-proof-tree]]","[[72-df-cut-degree]]","[[72-df-proof-height]]","[[72-df-exchange]]"],"source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.I §2.4.2 print37–42/PDF49–54; explicit nonprincipal-exchange permutation only","verification_status":"local exchange construction checked; original general multiset claim not established","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-lem-rank-reduction"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-lem-rank-reduction</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-rank-reduction — Rank Reduction Lemma"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c60a11e47ac58326\" href=\"?note=c60a11e47ac58326\" title=\"72-df-gentzen-system\">72-df-gentzen-system</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"81c9c855e009a6d4\" href=\"?note=81c9c855e009a6d4\" title=\"72-df-proof-tree\">72-df-proof-tree</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"715dbcdaf4fc3a32\" href=\"?note=715dbcdaf4fc3a32\" title=\"72-df-cut-degree\">72-df-cut-degree</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"eaf2215780d904d4\" href=\"?note=eaf2215780d904d4\" title=\"72-df-proof-height\">72-df-proof-height</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"e18594e1037dd7cd\" href=\"?note=e18594e1037dd7cd\" title=\"72-df-exchange\">72-df-exchange</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.I §2.4.2 print37–42/PDF49–54; explicit nonprincipal-exchange permutation only"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"local exchange construction checked; original general multiset claim not established"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\">\\(\\Sigma\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LK}^{-}_\\Sigma,\\mathrm{LK}_\\Sigma,\\mathrm{LJ}^{-}_\\Sigma,\\mathrm{LJ}_\\Sigma\">\\(\\mathrm{LK}^{-}_\\Sigma,\\mathrm{LK}_\\Sigma,\\mathrm{LJ}^{-}_\\Sigma,\\mathrm{LJ}_\\Sigma\\)</span> 均取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"c60a11e47ac58326\" href=\"?note=c60a11e47ac58326\" title=\"72-df-gentzen-system\">72-df-gentzen-system</a> 的实际序列演算；没有另加非逻辑初始式，逻辑等号没有额外公理。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Proof}_\\mathcal C\">\\(\\mathrm{Proof}_\\mathcal C\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"81c9c855e009a6d4\" href=\"?note=81c9c855e009a6d4\" title=\"72-df-proof-tree\">72-df-proof-tree</a> 的有限五元带标签证明集合。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi=\\langle D,\\prec,\\ell,\\mathrm{LK}_\\Sigma,\\eta\\rangle\">\\(\\pi=\\langle D,\\prec,\\ell,\\mathrm{LK}_\\Sigma,\\eta\\rangle\\)</span> 的根为切公式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 的Cut，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d=\\operatorname{rk}(A)+1\">\\(d=\\operatorname{rk}(A)+1\\)</span>；其他所有切公式秩小于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{rk}(A)\">\\(\\operatorname{rk}(A)\\)</span>。第0前提末规则为交换，其交换的两个公式出现均为侧公式，不是该切公式出现。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h_\\pi\">\\(h_\\pi\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"eaf2215780d904d4\" href=\"?note=eaf2215780d904d4\" title=\"72-df-proof-height\">72-df-proof-height</a> 的节点秩。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Mult}_d(\\pi)\">\\(\\operatorname{Mult}_d(\\pi)\\)</span> 是下式定义的有限重数函数；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\delta_n\">\\(\\delta_n\\)</span> 是在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 处值1、其余自然数处值0的函数。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Mult}_d(\\pi)(n):=|\\{u\\in\\operatorname{Cuts}(\\pi):\\operatorname{rk}(A_u)+1=d\\land h_\\pi(u\\frown\\langle0\\rangle)+h_\\pi(u\\frown\\langle1\\rangle)=n\\}|\\quad(n\\in\\omega).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Mult}_d(\\pi)(n):=|\\{u\\in\\operatorname{Cuts}(\\pi):\\operatorname{rk}(A_u)+1=d\\land h_\\pi(u\\frown\\langle0\\rangle)+h_\\pi(u\\frown\\langle1\\rangle)=n\\}|\\quad(n\\in\\omega).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"m:=h_\\pi(\\langle0\\rangle)+h_\\pi(\\langle1\\rangle),\\qquad\\operatorname{Mult}_d(\\pi)=\\delta_m.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[m:=h_\\pi(\\langle0\\rangle)+h_\\pi(\\langle1\\rangle),\\qquad\\operatorname{Mult}_d(\\pi)=\\delta_m.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists\\pi&#39;\\in\\mathrm{Proof}_{\\mathrm{LK}_\\Sigma}\\ (\\operatorname{Concl}(\\pi&#39;)=\\operatorname{Concl}(\\pi)\\land\\operatorname{CutDeg}(\\pi&#39;)=d\\land\\operatorname{Mult}_d(\\pi&#39;)=\\delta_{m-1}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists\\pi&#39;\\in\\mathrm{Proof}_{\\mathrm{LK}_\\Sigma}\\ (\\operatorname{Concl}(\\pi&#39;)=\\operatorname{Concl}(\\pi)\\land\\operatorname{CutDeg}(\\pi&#39;)=d\\land\\operatorname{Mult}_d(\\pi&#39;)=\\delta_{m-1}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>把第0前提的侧公式交换移到根Cut下方；新Cut左前提高度恰减1，右前提保持，之后交换恢复相同根结论。m≥1，且最高度切仍只有这一例。旧笼统“越过任意非主规则（包括收缩）使全证明多重集下降”缺少节点追踪和复制子证明的控制，不能凭常见术语宣称已核验；现仅确认这一真实单步交换置换。完整收缩/二分支归约及全局终止度量仍未由本条建立，Hauptsatz保留来源定理资格。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-gentzen-system","status":"resolved","id":"c60a11e47ac58326","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-gentzen-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-proof-tree","status":"resolved","id":"81c9c855e009a6d4","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-proof-tree]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-cut-degree","status":"resolved","id":"715dbcdaf4fc3a32","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-cut-degree]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-proof-height","status":"resolved","id":"eaf2215780d904d4","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-proof-height]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-exchange","status":"resolved","id":"e18594e1037dd7cd","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-exchange]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-gentzen-system","status":"resolved","id":"c60a11e47ac58326","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma$、$\\mathrm{LK}^{-}_\\Sigma,\\mathrm{LK}_\\Sigma,\\mathrm{LJ}^{-}_\\Sigma,\\mathrm{LJ}_\\Sigma$ 均取 [[72-df-gentzen-system]] 的实际序列演算；没有另加非逻辑初始式，逻辑等号没有额外公理。$\\mathrm{Proof}_\\mathcal C$ 是 [[72-df-proof-tree]] 的有限五元带标签证明集合。","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-proof-tree","status":"resolved","id":"81c9c855e009a6d4","anchor":"ref-7",